{"title":"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9b01e32ab1f00dceffbf6199f0a25d1a451bb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\frac{x}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"33\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f548915ecbe42087258ec53873c8c182ea9b2a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=\\frac{x}{3x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"33\" />. \n</p><p>(a) Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77de3602095d356b693a8affff2f66d92baa1b94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\circ g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f2149a3a77f823a303d09cd0f617eac6b751b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g\\circ f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>(b) Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d6820b2221a441fe5be0da11057b41c91721d5c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underbrace{h\\circ h\\circ \\cdot \\circ h}_\\text{n times} := h^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"136\" height=\"35\" />. \nDetermine all the functions in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/17578c8a6678db4786e6541ee3aff70230fa91ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{H | H = (g\\circ f)^n\\circ g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c9141fc7f10c58675063bcfc2cfa6fe33cb988b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H = (f\\circ g)^n\\circ f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> a whole number<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e2585c1b1cd632b41a41481fd2ad44456aeec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a)Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/5/5753747ee5724601b7f05adac8348f630ba3a0d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f \\circ g(x)= f(g(x))\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/4/554b1378c30de0d4f88c9260c7d30ecd7e9ab68c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies f(\\frac{x}{3x-1})=\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/330770e43dd100f311f9d7cf60fd22075f287255.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{x}{3x-1}}{\\frac{x}{3x-1}-1}=\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f5653aa6dbb61e5e912cdd9f8783303eb095aac8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{x}{3x-1}}{\\frac{-2x+1}{3x-1}}=\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/615d4989ee0d129c2a94236a6ffc22545db5f577.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\frac{x}{3x-1} \\cdot \\frac{3x-1}{-2x+1}=\\]\" width=\"193\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/3/1735a28c1d23d93bbc0fde99fdb88caa56e9e823.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\frac{x}{1-2x}}\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f081bae162b9f2d072b66e5123e93c52aff6cea5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[g \\circ f(x)=g(f(x))=\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/0/770e7d54f419d3660b2ca93749da13cdb4215522.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[g(\\frac{x}{x-1})=\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/125cac61fd3321a7d19ac1f5ca462a10e4d0a984.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{x}{x-1}}{\\frac{3x}{x-1}-1}=\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/5/4b5048befc920b14b2f9b1a2be254efd15a5d120.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{x}{x-1}}{\\frac{2x+1}{x-1}}=\\]\" width=\"55\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a27188517f6a6c90a340d58a8a59270e0d9dafb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\frac{x}{2x+1}}\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><br /><br />(b)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef94f7da6d05c1420bd9afa79db082c9ce9028e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\Big\\{ \\frac{x}{(2n+1)x-1} | n\\in \\mathbb{Z} \\Big \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"219\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.